# Kosala: from the hills to the Sai and Gomti, between Panchala and the Sadanira (Gandak).
:pol_kosala geo:hasGeometry [ geo:asWKT "POLYGON((80.4 28.6, 81.6 28.25, 83.0 27.6, 84.1 27.45, 84.5 26.6, 84.0 26.0, 83.1 25.8, 82.0 26.0, 81.0 26.4, 80.4 27.3, 80.4 28.6))"^^geo:wktLiteral ;
